cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use IMMCA or its rule data, please cite it as below."
title: "IMMCA: an open, source-linked screener for Canadian immigration pathways"
abstract: >-
  A browser-only rules engine and trilingual (English, French, Chinese) web app that
  matches a person's profile against 53 federal, Québec and provincial permanent-residence
  programs, computes the Express Entry CRS under both the current and the 2026-11-03 rules,
  and links every requirement to the official government page it was verified against.
authors:
  - family-names: Zhou
    given-names: Ziyi
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-27
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/EllenSyuu/IMMCA"
keywords:
  - immigration
  - Canada
  - Express Entry
  - rules engine
  - eligibility screening
  - i18n
